| Exact-source two-loop theta | `cff/mod.rs::exact_two_loop_source_matches_the_signed_theta_contour` | Protects the exact-source bridge against the same independent coupled-loop value |
| Shifted odd triangle joined to a bubble at one vertex | `three-dimensional-reps/src/generation.rs:10250`, `connected_triangle_bubble_matches_independent_contour_product`: explicitly sums the triangle's clockwise Below simple-pole residues, multiplied by an independently written signed bubble formula; tests unit and quadratic numerator | Exercises shifted odd triangle signs and connected incidence. The energy integrals factorize; this is not the historical coupled double triangle or three-loop TBT |
| Scalar terminal/tadpole and attached unequal-energy bubble | `three-dimensional-reps/src/generation.rs:9230`, `ordinary_terminal_sources_match_signed_contours`: literal `-1/(2E)` and explicit two-pole bubble residue sum in standalone and embedded contexts | Covers complete signed contours and composition, at different inputs |
