`three-dimensional-reps/src/eval.rs::reversed_vacuum_triangle_incidence_preserves_generalized_cff` compares full values under incidence reversal. It is useful metamorphic coverage but uses the same evaluator on both sides; it is **not counted as an independent numerical oracle** here. Likewise, adapter parity and owner relabelling checks cannot by themselves supply independent provenance for the removed decimals.

## Fresh actions and disposition

Read-only Git history/source inspection covered target introduction, the relevant target-bearing migrations, exact deleted function bodies and evaluator normalization, and the current coverage listed above. This follow-up only writes the `/tmp` archive/report; no Rust files, staged prefix, manifests, Cargo state, or jj history were changed. The earlier authorized private-assertion cleanup remains separately recorded in the full CFF review. No tests were run, retried, or updated.

